{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09259","headline":"池上怀王卿 · 韦应物","name":"池上怀王卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽居捐世事，佳雨散园芳。\n入门霭已緑，水禽鸣春塘。\n重云始成夕，忽霁尚残阳。\n轻舟因风泛，郡阁望苍苍。\n私燕阻外好，临欢一停觞。\n兹游无时尽，旭日愿相将。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}